# MANIFEST.v2.sha256 — casg-direct-v3-repro, study version v2
#
# The COMPLETE freeze-by-digest manifest (CHARTER.md): every executor-visible
# artifact, the model artifact, the sampling regime, the runner build, and the
# assay image, pinned before the first treatment run of this version.
#
# Registered: 2026-07-14, task register-v2-manifest, chain instrument-hold-lift.
# Supersedes MANIFEST.v1.sha256 (corpus-side only; never backed a scored run).
# Version history + applied drain items: CHANGELOG.md
#
# A scored run counts only if EVERY digest below matches at scoring time. Any
# change to any pinned artifact is a v3 bump with a fresh manifest; runs never
# span versions. A result whose manifest cannot be reproduced is an anecdote,
# not data.
#
